{"text":{"en":{"DWCK 드라이 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"DWCK Dry Bearing | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">DWCK Dry Bearing</p> <h2>DWCK 드라이 베어링</h2> <p>DWC 와셔형에 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">핀홀</strong>을 추가해 회전 방지가 필요한 부위에 사용하는 타입입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">DWCK Dry Bearing</p> <h2>DWCK Dry Bearing</h2> <p>A type with a <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">pin hole</strong> added to the DWC washer type, used in locations that require anti-rotation.</p>","<img src=\"assets/dwck_diagram.png\" alt=\"DWCK 드라이 베어링 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 정면도(핀홀·P.C.D) · 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=안지름 · D=바깥지름</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/dwck_diagram.png\" alt=\"DWCK Dry Bearing Drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Front View (Pin Hole · P.C.D) · Cross-Section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Inner Diameter · D=Outer Diameter</span></p>","<label for=\"dwckFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"dwckFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: DWCK 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"dwckFilter\">Model Search</label> <input id=\"dwckFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. DWCK 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"dwckCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"dwckToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"dwckCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"dwckToggleAll\">Expand All</button>","전체 규격<span class=\"series-count\">14건</span>":"All Specs<span class=\"series-count\">14 items</span>"},"ja":{"DWCK 드라이 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"DWCK ドライベアリング | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">DWCK Dry Bearing</p> <h2>DWCK 드라이 베어링</h2> <p>DWC 와셔형에 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">핀홀</strong>을 추가해 회전 방지가 필요한 부위에 사용하는 타입입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">DWCK Dry Bearing</p> <h2>DWCKドライベアリング</h2> <p>DWCワッシャー形に<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">ピンホール</strong>を追加し、回転防止が必要な部位に使用するタイプです。</p>","<img src=\"assets/dwck_diagram.png\" alt=\"DWCK 드라이 베어링 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 정면도(핀홀·P.C.D) · 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=안지름 · D=바깥지름</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/dwck_diagram.png\" alt=\"DWCKドライベアリング図面\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 正面図(ピンホール・P.C.D)・断面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径・D=外径</span></p>","<label for=\"dwckFilter\">형번 검색</label> <input id=\"dwckFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: DWCK 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"dwckFilter\">型番検索</label> <input id=\"dwckFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: DWCK 20\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"dwckCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"dwckToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"dwckCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"dwckToggleAll\">すべて展開</button>","전체 규격<span class=\"series-count\">14건</span>":"全規格<span class=\"series-count\">14件</span>"},"zh":{"DWCK 드라이 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"DWCK 干式轴承 | [公司名] 轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">DWCK Dry Bearing</p> <h2>DWCK 드라이 베어링</h2> <p>DWC 와셔형에 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">핀홀</strong>을 추가해 회전 방지가 필요한 부위에 사용하는 타입입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">DWCK Dry Bearing</p> <h2>DWCK干式轴承</h2> <p>在DWC垫圈型基础上增加<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">销孔</strong>，用于需要防旋转的部位。</p>","<img src=\"assets/dwck_diagram.png\" alt=\"DWCK 드라이 베어링 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 정면도(핀홀·P.C.D) · 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=안지름 · D=바깥지름</span></p>":"<img src=\"assets/dwck_diagram.png\" alt=\"DWCK干式轴